OL,3,GNEWSARecord-smashing motorcycle 'the
OL,4,Astar' of exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,F"After 60 years, Super Nero is going
OL,7,Fhome."
OL,9,FIn 1966, motorcycle racer George Brown
OL,10,Fset 11 world and 16 national speed
OL,11,Frecords at former RAF station Greenham
OL,12,FCommon near Newbury, Berkshire.
OL,14,FNow his motorcycle Super Nero is "the
OL,15,Fstar" of an exhibition at Greenham
OL,16,FCommon Control Tower until 17 December,
OL,17,Floaned to the charity by the National
OL,18,FMotorcycle Museum.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
